<div class="leftColumn"><h2>Monaco</h2>
<p><a href="/europe.html">[one level up]</a></p>    <p class="isPublicInfo">
        The OpenStreetMap data files provided on this server do <b>not</b> contain the user names, user
        IDs and changeset IDs of the OSM objects because these fields are assumed to contain personal
        information about the OpenStreetMap contributors and are therefore subject to data protection regulations
        in the European Union. 
        <br>
        <a href="https://osm-internal.download.geofabrik.de/europe/monaco.html">Extracts with full metadata</a> are available to OpenStreetMap
        contributors only.
    </p>
<h3>Commonly Used Formats</h3>
<ul>
<li><a href="monaco-latest.osm.pbf">monaco-latest.osm.pbf</a>, suitable for
           Osmium, Osmosis, imposm, osm2pgsql, mkgmap, and others. This file was last 
           modified 15 hours ago and contains all OSM data up to 2026-11-14T21:20:41Z. File size: 691&nbsp;KB. </li>

<li><a href="monaco-latest-free.shp.zip">monaco-latest-free.shp.zip</a>, yields
               a number of ESRI compatible shape files when unzipped. <a href="/osm-data-in-gis-formats-free.pdf">(Format description PDF)</a>
               This file was last modified 8 hours ago. File size: 730&nbsp;KB. </li>

<li><a href="monaco-latest-free.gpkg.zip">monaco-latest-free.gpkg.zip</a>, same as
               shape file but in more modern Geopackage format.
               This file was last modified 8 hours ago. File size: 740&nbsp;KB. </li>
</ul><h3>Other Formats and Auxiliary Files</h3>
